    <string name="automation_setup_tasker_title">Set up in Tasker</string>
    <string name="automation_setup_tasker">In Tasker, add a Plugin action, event or state and choose Tandem. Actions add a transaction or read the budget; events fire when a category goes over budget, a schedule is due or a sync fails.</string>
    <string name="automation_setup_shortcuts_title">Set up in Shortcuts</string>
    <string name="automation_setup_shortcuts">Open the Shortcuts app and search for Tandem to add its actions. Siri can run them too.</string>
    <string name="automation_title">Automation</string>
    <string name="automation_detail">Let apps such as Tasker work with the open budget. Each stays off until you turn it on. An encrypted budget works only while Schedule background sync keeps its password on this device.</string>
    <string name="automation_detail_assistants">Let apps such as Tasker, and assistants such as Gemini, work with the open budget. Each stays off until you turn it on. An encrypted budget works only while Schedule background sync keeps its password on this device.</string>
    <string name="automation_detail_shortcuts">Let Shortcuts and Siri work with the open budget. Each stays off until you turn it on. Encrypted budgets can’t be used from Shortcuts.</string>
    <string name="automation_writes">Allow automation apps to add transactions</string>
    <string name="automation_writes_detail">Apps can add a transaction to the open budget with an amount, payee, category, account, date, notes and cleared state. Actual’s rules run on it, a notification offers Undo, and Change History names the app. Apps can’t change or delete anything.</string>
    <string name="automation_reads">Allow automation apps to read balances</string>
    <string name="automation_reads_detail">Apps can read a month’s left to spend, budgeted, spent and ready to assign amounts, for the whole budget or one category, and an account’s balance. After each background sync they’re also told when a category goes over budget, a schedule is due today or a sync fails. They can’t see transactions, payees or notes, and get no budget numbers or names while app lock or Hide budget amounts is on.</string>
